&_nc_oc=AdpCkyNwTVnR45JqbOO4xC7WDyp0gq5mqDNaX51rWXYtONl1_2HdYlqU84eYVLrzH10&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAYbG-384HTdQpTe-n6Ag3yCi1fgJOxzt5M-dTKGJ13vw&oe=6A5B607E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=82K2abJuAb4Q7kNvwH9nYJn&_nc_oc=AdrTi9RlZedjJP-rH14U3I-KYGqtThlYEqKZDPxxmRd4J76_Ucd3Gd2V8Ld1vQRkXpY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDJSWqwNBCthOUyAaD7WuONi9gZF3eNd7sgMivRokfa2A&oe=6A5B717C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3vOzbjUSBY4Q7kNvwF0Yq_I&_nc_oc=AdrQIueskY36RXppr6XoIBRFwoYEq4eWHbFiNH3pI0rRa7OIHtsNBgxh0ikd6IxpG_k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBnh1NmjO5dla6ys2qsQ3V1KFuoglvu7GI0U661EPknqw&oe=6A5B9007"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tC3VgH_eIlkQ7kNvwGLPQJE&_nc_oc=Adpkwc-lQmi1r6vxTJA5KXT2JHICLtzQdVWLfk9F8NNNeon5pBMO6y-dIGdJI-99nYI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCps8GNR3ImVI5b55HDOK6N2Re36qxMCvzvhU1CPk39bg&oe=6A5B7BD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tpdzCOQFKVoQ7kNvwG_K-bS&_nc_oc=Adrj-B2V86REvqd0i1N1DcH2eEQ5CBK-jH29YCk3Jil5vqZWpcwm5bwqp5XMVnyDZDo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAr57hiE2KioGeCAZcaJvT5x3FOziUANKxPmAXvScQizg&oe=6A5B8864"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.